#. Key:	6721A9984AE0CD577C269C9550292252
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/DiceGames/UMG_DiceGame_Liar.UMG_DiceGame_Liar_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc_1.Text
#: /Game/Widgets/DiceGames/UMG_DiceGame_Liar.UMG_DiceGame_Liar_C:WidgetTree.T_WindowDesc_1.Text
msgid "How to play:\r\n- Players roll five dice each and keep their results hidden.\r\n- Players take turns to bid on the count and value of dice, such as \"four 3s\".\r\n- Players can challenge a bid if they think it’s false. \r\n- If the total number of dice matching the bid is equal to or greater than the bid, the bid is correct and the challenger loses. If the bid is incorrect, the bidder loses."
msgstr "游戏规则:\r\n- 每位玩家摇5枚骰子,并将结果隐藏。\r\n- 玩家轮流叫牌,如\"四个3\"。\r\n- 玩家可质疑他人的叫牌。\r\n- 若符合叫牌的骰子数量等于或超过叫牌数,则叫牌正确,质疑者输;否则叫牌者输。""

#. Key:	02ABD0F04E62182B7523198EDDFA8195
