msgstr "看看你能做什么，制作以下物品。"

#. Key:	16A9029B40C25C49A3FD63BAF679FFAB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Who said fishing is boring? It's exploring with a big reward in the end. Mysterious fish can be found everywhere."
msgstr "谁说钓鱼无聊?这是一种探索,最终会有大奖励。到处都能发现神秘的鱼。"

#. Key:	178117BD4C48AF461430AAAA3356652A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Explore all the House upgrade paths to discover new possibilities."
msgstr "探索所有房屋升级路径,发现新可能性。"

#. Key:	260D6CDA4A9EB8AD08F627B5828CE66F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "Be ready for nights when there's no solar power!"
msgstr "做好准备迎接没有太阳能的夜晚!"

#. Key:	2944073B49A41E8A6D6CE4B335B554E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
msgid "To become a master fisher. You will need to find catch all the fishes there is."
msgstr "成为一名钓鱼大师。你需要找到并捕捉所有的鱼。"

#. Key:	3223971F4720B4FD53627AB71562FA5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Widgets/Inventory/UMG_QuestDetails.UMG_QuestDetails_C:GetQuestDescription [Script Bytecode]
